// The Return (bible 7.3 step 5, 9.5): the Threshold from inside. Voss is still at the line. If Wren carries Corra's
// memory out, she gives it him, and he says the one word he does not say; he goes in to find her. If not, he holds
// the line, and the Observatory will have a statue it did not have before (NAR-13).
// Marrow echoes Voss; its third word. The word is not the scene's: nobody here says it.

title: Return_Voss
---
<<if not has_flag("act3.started")>>
    Voss: Journeyman. The line holds. Go and rest. #line:0b90868
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<if has_flag("return.voss.met")>>
    <<if has_flag("voss.changed")>>
        Threshold: His tethers, dropped at the line. His footprints go in. #still #line:05ef102
    <<else>>
        Voss: The line holds, journeyman. It will hold after you. #still #line:096eb01
    <<endif>>
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Voss: Journeyman. You came back out. So it can be done. #line:0f925fa
<<if has_flag("corra.memory_carried")>>
    Threshold: She holds out the small drawing. A heron, crayon-lined, the right size. #line:03d6408
    Voss: ... #line:0a33fc8
    Voss: Corra. #line:07eca93
    Voss: She drew me the right size. When did I— she drew me the right size. #line:06f9d0f
    Voss: I am going in. Today. Hold the line for me, journeyman. Somebody should. #line:0fb7645
    <<flag voss.changed 1>>
<<else>>
    Voss: We will not. Somebody must hold the line. #line:0eed512
    Voss: Go and do what you came to do. We will be here. We are always here. #line:0e70fd9
<<endif>>
<<flag return.voss.met 1>>
===

title: Threshold_Marrow
---
<<if flag("marrow.words") >= 3>>
    Lantern: The grey chick, one pace back, one to the left. #still #line:09ec04d
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<if not has_flag("return.voss.met") or flag("marrow.words") < 2>>
    Lantern: The grey chick stops at the line and waits for her. #line:0eac1d9
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<if has_flag("voss.changed")>>
    Marrow: The right size. #echo:voss #line:0b55768
<<else>>
    Marrow: Hold the line. #echo:voss #line:0fbb3ce
<<endif>>
Marrow: Look. #line:05793aa
<<flag marrow.words 3>>
===
